(
    'Coord defaults to Pixel, Size to 400 600 and Posn to 100 100.'

    'The `Picture` property must refer to a file which resides in one of the folders'
    'defined in the EWC.RESOURCES array. See [Images](../Usage/Configuration.md)'
    'for more information.'
    '`IconObj` and `AutoConf` are accepted and ignored. Neither has a browser'
    'equivalent: there is no window icon, and layout is not auto-configured.'
    'They are accepted rather than warned about because an application setting'
    'them is not doing anything wrong, and a warning on every ⎕WC of a form is'
    'noise that hides real ones.'
    ''
    '`Caption` sets the browser tab title.'
)
